# ReliefWeb (UN OCHA) situation-reports feed.
# v2 refuses unregistered callers — you must request an approved `appname`
# at https://apidoc.reliefweb.int/ and set it here. Until then the app falls
# back to a curated list of situation-report links (see src/lib/sources/reliefweb.ts).
RELIEFWEB_APPNAME=your-approved-appname
